.Dd November 16, 2026
.Dt STRINGS 1
.Os RavenBSD
.Sh NAME
.Nm strings
.Nd extract printable runs from files
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm
.Op Fl a
.Op Fl n Ar number
.Ar file ...
.Sh DESCRIPTION
The
.Nm
utility prints runs of printable ASCII bytes at least
.Ar number
characters long (default 4).
The target image currently requires at least one file; the host byte-stream core also covers
standard input.
.Pp
The options are:
.Bl -tag -width Ds
.It Fl a
Scan every file (the default; accepted for compatibility).
.It Fl n Ar number
Set the minimum run length.
.El
.Sh EXIT STATUS
.Ex -std
0 on success, 2 for usage or an I/O error.
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr grep 1
.Sh STANDARDS
RavenBSD.
